Changelog: 11-10-2026 20:58:28

MetricBox centres its value and caption by default, like Bazzite Test's stats boxes; centred=False keeps them left-aligned. test_widgets checks the default; test_parity compares centred and left-aligned boxes with both governor's and helixsr's copies.

Changelog: 11-10-2026 19:02:46

instance.py: Two launches at the same moment (a double-click on a Desktop icon that opens on one click) no longer
open two windows. Both found no running instance, since the window and its socket take a while to appear, and the
second then removed the first one's socket. The first launch now takes a lock file at once; a launch that finds it
taken waits up to 10 s for that instance's socket and hands over instead. A crashed instance's lock is stale, so the
next launch starts as before. The apps that bundle core (portal, Bazzite Test, ACE Queues, BIOS Reader, Memory
Manager, System Overlay, Portal dependency checker) get it with their next release. Tests in tests/test_instance.py.

Changelog: 11-10-2026 07:28:24

Version 0.1.2. Shared UI improvements

Changelog: 11-10-2026 01:05:44

Header status widget StatusText: a coloured dot and the state in bold, in the colour of its kind (red bad, orange warn, green ok, blue info, the normal text colour for neutral), with the same set_status() and text() as StatusPill. For a state next to an app's title, where a pill is too heavy; StatusPill stays for cards.

Changelog: 10-10-2026 20:56:48

Version 0.1.1. Initial release

Changelog: 09-10-2026 22:59:08

SUITE_MANUAL_URL: the address of the suite manual on GitHub Pages. README: short, with a link to the manual.

Changelog: 09-10-2026 18:22:39

MetricBox has an optional centred=True that centres the value and caption (helixsr's header uses it); the default
renders as before. The parity test covers the centred box against helixsr's copy.

tests/test_instance.py deletes its server and window explicitly: left to Python's collection at exit, they made the
interpreter crash after the last test in about half of the runs (the tests themselves passed).

Changelog: 09-10-2026 17:51:51

New module bc250_core.instance: one running instance per app and user over a local socket (after the
governor's instance.py). A second launch hands its Wayland activation token to the running instance,
which brings its window to the front. Tests in core/tests/test_instance.py.

Changelog: 08-10-2026 22:26:29

Initial version 0.1.0 of bc250_core, the code the suite's apps share. It is bundled into each app release.
- appinfo: AppInfo.
- theme: the palette and Inter font.
- text: fmt, fill, plain_tooltip, window_title.
- widgets: StatusPill, MetricBox, ClickableLogo, Terminal, TextDialog, RoundedToolTip with show/hide_tooltip,
  page_header, hint_label, accent_button, set_button_active.
- app: create_app, run_app, exec_app.
- settings: open_settings at each app's existing file, geometry helpers, SettingsStore.
- help: HelpView, HelpPage.
- updates: latest_release with a tag prefix for the suite's per-app tags, UpdateStatus, UpdateChecker.
- platform: XDG folders, xdg_open, launch_in_terminal with an exit file.
